@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-token
@memoryId = 01J00000000000000000000010

### List my learner memories (newest update first); q matches content ignoring case and accents (up to 100 characters); category is one of explanation_preference, declared_knowledge, interest_or_intention, recurring_difficulty (invalid value: 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/intelligence/learner-memories?q=exemplos&category=explanation_preference
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List all my learner memories
GET {{baseUrl}}/intelligence/learner-memories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read one learner memory; 404 when absent, malformed or owned by another account
GET {{baseUrl}}/intelligence/learner-memories/{{memoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Edit the content of a learner memory; 409 when expected_version is stale, 422 when content has 0 or more than 280 characters after trimming
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/intelligence/learner-memories/{{memoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Prefiro exemplos curtos em Python.",
  "expected_version": 1
}

### Delete a learner memory; 204 also when it is absent, malformed, already deleted or owned by another account
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/intelligence/learner-memories/{{memoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
